<p id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ A.2.2 ETT ‣ A.2 Detailed Metrics on Monash and ETT ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ In-Context Fine-Tuning for Time-Series Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> presents the MAE numbers of TimesFM-ICF against other methods on ETTh1, ETTh2, ETTm1 and ETTm2 respectively, with forecasting horizons of 96 and 192 respectively.</p>
